WEBVTT

00:00.720 --> 00:03.520
♪Shrugging off past burdens♪

00:03.520 --> 00:06.110
♪Beneath the mask, who am I?♪

00:06.780 --> 00:10.180
♪Release and find wider shores♪

00:11.880 --> 00:14.890
♪Love's a riddle, and rain pours heavy♪

00:15.260 --> 00:17.790
♪Crossed paths, now downward fall♪

00:18.130 --> 00:21.570
♪From dust arises starlight's spark♪

00:23.320 --> 00:28.540
♪Tearing through
the night's dense blockade♪

00:29.220 --> 00:34.300
♪Heart's flame illuminates all solitude♪

00:35.100 --> 00:37.590
♪Let time's sails drift endlessly♪

00:37.590 --> 00:40.200
♪Through wandering exile♪

00:40.720 --> 00:47.980
♪Breaking free from the cocoon,
I start anew♪

00:48.950 --> 00:51.710
♪Moon as song, life as flame♪

00:51.770 --> 00:54.610
♪Nameless heart clings fiercely♪

00:54.900 --> 00:55.930
♪Let me♪

00:56.120 --> 01:00.200
♪Charge toward the next raging river♪

01:00.650 --> 01:03.330
♪Moon darts, snow falls♪

01:03.620 --> 01:06.320
♪We tread rugged paths to reunite♪

01:06.490 --> 01:07.960
♪Hands held tight♪

01:07.960 --> 01:12.130
♪We forever live for love's sake♪

01:12.490 --> 01:22.740
♪Shadow's spear burns fiercely♪

01:24.170 --> 01:29.720
=Legend of The Female General=

01:29.920 --> 01:32.740
=Episode 11=

01:42.750 --> 01:44.910
Poison first, and then assassinate.

01:46.430 --> 01:47.110
He Rufei

01:47.110 --> 01:48.350
hasn't changed a bit.

01:50.030 --> 01:52.110
But his attempt to kill Xiao Jue

01:52.270 --> 01:54.180
is because of the Mingshui Battle.

01:57.190 --> 01:58.470
He Rufei is getting desperate.

01:59.270 --> 02:01.030
Truly like a cornered beast lashing out.

02:12.870 --> 02:13.950
We should question

02:14.390 --> 02:16.870
General Feihong, who supported Mingshui.

02:17.310 --> 02:19.670
As a firsthand witness,

02:19.790 --> 02:23.030
he should know the truth.

02:26.070 --> 02:27.030
General Fengyun,

02:28.150 --> 02:29.870
I immediately dispatched troops

02:30.150 --> 02:31.750
upon receiving the distress call,

02:31.829 --> 02:33.590
without any delay.

02:33.750 --> 02:34.910
He Rufei,

02:35.829 --> 02:36.710
it was you

02:37.590 --> 02:39.070
who delayed reinforcement

02:40.990 --> 02:42.150
and caused my father

02:43.550 --> 02:45.590
and the Xiao Army troops

02:45.710 --> 02:46.870
to perish tragically!

02:47.270 --> 02:47.790
(No.)

02:48.190 --> 02:49.310
(Upon receiving the letter,)

02:49.630 --> 02:50.670
(I dispatched troops.)

02:51.310 --> 02:52.230
(Why did Xiao Jue say)

02:52.270 --> 02:53.430
(I delayed the rescue?)

02:55.230 --> 02:56.740
Xiao Jue would never lie.

02:57.470 --> 02:58.950
There must be something wrong.

03:01.230 --> 03:02.550
Even the whole Mingshui Battle

03:03.790 --> 03:04.990
might be a conspiracy,

03:05.910 --> 03:07.270
to eliminate

03:07.950 --> 03:09.030
General Xiao

03:09.790 --> 03:11.070
and the Xiao Army.

03:13.190 --> 03:14.270
(I heard General Xiao)

03:14.590 --> 03:16.590
(often opposed Chancellor Xu in court.)

03:17.550 --> 03:19.150
(Though Chancellor Xu appears virtuous,)

03:19.790 --> 03:20.870
(everyone knows)

03:21.190 --> 03:22.190
(he's vindictive.)

03:23.150 --> 03:24.510
(This must be his doing.)

03:26.110 --> 03:26.990
(As for He Rufei,)

03:27.670 --> 03:29.550
(he sent Ding Yi to kill Xiao Jue.)

03:30.390 --> 03:31.829
(Did he get involved too)

03:32.310 --> 03:33.310
(and fear exposure?)

03:36.390 --> 03:37.430
(It doesn't make sense.)

03:38.230 --> 03:39.270
(Before Mingshui Battle,)

03:39.710 --> 03:41.230
(He Rufei was still at Yuhua Temple.)

03:42.150 --> 03:43.390
(He couldn't have interfered)

03:43.430 --> 03:44.430
(with military matters.)

03:52.390 --> 03:53.670
He Rufei likely feared

03:53.710 --> 03:54.670
his identity

03:55.390 --> 03:57.390
being exposed by Xiao Jue,
his former classmate.

03:58.150 --> 03:58.950
Even so,

03:59.550 --> 04:00.430
I mustn't allow him

04:00.830 --> 04:02.270
to keep exploiting this identity

04:02.870 --> 04:04.430
for mischief.

04:18.589 --> 04:19.110
Wang Ba,

04:19.350 --> 04:20.630
next time you ambush someone,

04:20.870 --> 04:22.140
lighten your footsteps.

04:22.230 --> 04:22.750
It...

04:22.750 --> 04:24.350
It wasn't an ambush!

04:24.630 --> 04:25.670
I just wanted to check

04:25.710 --> 04:28.070
if your skills have got rusty.

04:28.070 --> 04:28.700
Wang,

04:28.950 --> 04:29.710
you seem

04:29.710 --> 04:30.720
thoughtless.

04:31.390 --> 04:32.590
Mr. Shen warned us

04:32.790 --> 04:33.500
that He

04:33.500 --> 04:34.270
was injured.

04:34.270 --> 04:35.030
Why test him now?

04:35.070 --> 04:35.870
You're thoughtless.

04:36.070 --> 04:36.870
By the way, He Yan,

04:36.870 --> 04:37.710
how's your injury?

04:38.230 --> 04:39.350
Minor wound. It's healing.

04:39.430 --> 04:40.310
It has scabbed over.

04:40.510 --> 04:41.230
In that case,

04:41.470 --> 04:42.830
we're taking you somewhere

04:43.110 --> 04:44.310
as a welcome celebration.

04:44.480 --> 04:45.280
Right.

04:45.510 --> 04:46.020
I'll lead.

04:47.470 --> 04:48.100
Let's go.

05:22.350 --> 05:25.150
Commander, since He Yan has nothing
to do with He Rufei,

05:25.790 --> 05:27.230
why keep Mr. Shen

05:27.270 --> 05:27.950
monitoring him?

05:28.550 --> 05:30.190
Even if he's not He Rufei's man,

05:30.830 --> 05:31.620
he still has

05:32.130 --> 05:33.390
questionable aspects.

05:33.990 --> 05:35.270
We must stay vigilant.

05:36.110 --> 05:37.510
With enemies at our door,

05:38.630 --> 05:39.840
the Xiao Army

05:40.870 --> 05:41.830
can't endure

05:41.830 --> 05:42.870
another storm.

05:46.990 --> 05:47.790
Where's He Yan

05:48.470 --> 05:49.150
right now?

05:49.830 --> 05:51.590
She was dragged by his peers
to a hot spring.

05:58.909 --> 06:00.070
Mai, I can't do it!

06:00.510 --> 06:01.070
Listen to me.

06:01.070 --> 06:01.790
Listen to me!

06:02.430 --> 06:03.670
My wound hasn't healed yet.

06:03.790 --> 06:04.550
I can't do this.

06:08.990 --> 06:09.790
He,

06:10.110 --> 06:11.190
don't worry.

06:11.550 --> 06:12.060
Look.

06:12.270 --> 06:13.350
The hot spring water

06:13.510 --> 06:14.190
is very shallow.

06:14.270 --> 06:14.910
Only waist-deep.

06:15.270 --> 06:15.910
Rest assured.

06:16.350 --> 06:17.550
Your wound

06:17.590 --> 06:18.230
will be fine.

06:18.270 --> 06:19.070
Don't worry, okay?

06:19.150 --> 06:20.190
- Right.
- Exactly.

06:20.190 --> 06:21.990
We're all men.

06:22.190 --> 06:23.670
Come down. It'll be fine.

06:23.670 --> 06:25.150
- Exactly.
- Yeah, come on down.

06:25.150 --> 06:26.150
- He Yan.
- Join us.

06:26.870 --> 06:27.390
He Yan,

06:27.390 --> 06:28.350
soaking in hot springs

06:28.350 --> 06:29.030
is good for you.

06:29.070 --> 06:30.190
A short soak won't hurt.

06:30.270 --> 06:31.360
You're not a lady.

06:31.630 --> 06:32.430
Come down quickly.

06:33.659 --> 06:34.350
- Hurry.
- Hurry.

06:34.350 --> 06:35.630
Hurry down and play with us.

06:36.030 --> 06:36.710
Come down.

06:36.790 --> 06:37.909
- Come soak a bit.
- Come on.

06:38.350 --> 06:39.310
No, I can't.

06:39.430 --> 06:40.070
It feels good.

06:40.270 --> 06:41.150
Just come down.

06:42.070 --> 06:43.030
Don't run. Join us.

06:43.350 --> 06:44.030
Come on.

06:46.470 --> 06:47.030
Stop running.

06:47.350 --> 06:48.270
I really can't do this.

06:48.430 --> 06:49.270
- I can't...
- Hurry.

06:49.270 --> 06:49.990
I can't. I...

06:50.080 --> 06:50.690
Pull him down.

06:50.690 --> 06:51.200
I can't.

06:52.670 --> 06:53.350
Come on.

06:54.300 --> 06:54.830
I...

06:54.830 --> 06:55.830
I really can't. I...

06:55.950 --> 06:56.630
Come on.

07:02.710 --> 07:03.310
Commander.

07:03.350 --> 07:04.430
- Commander.
- Commander.

07:06.390 --> 07:07.070
Commander,

07:07.070 --> 07:08.710
you arrived just in time.

07:08.790 --> 07:09.310
Get up.

07:13.060 --> 07:13.630
Commander.

07:15.870 --> 07:17.230
Don't take him to hot springs.

07:18.310 --> 07:18.830
Commander.

07:20.950 --> 07:21.590
Why...

07:21.750 --> 07:24.870
Why can't we bring him along?

07:25.150 --> 07:26.030
Yeah, why?

07:26.110 --> 07:27.190
Why?

07:29.870 --> 07:30.750
He's physically weak.

07:32.430 --> 07:33.190
Physically weak?

07:33.630 --> 07:35.350
He seems perfectly healthy to me.

07:36.510 --> 07:37.750
Physically weak?

07:37.909 --> 07:38.990
Well... Um...

07:39.990 --> 07:40.710
I...

07:41.310 --> 07:41.990
Won't you go?

07:43.510 --> 07:44.030
Or

07:44.470 --> 07:45.390
do you want to go down?

07:49.700 --> 07:50.270
Commander,

07:50.430 --> 07:51.550
are you telling the truth?

07:51.580 --> 07:52.130
He...

07:52.710 --> 07:54.150
How could he be physically weak?

07:54.530 --> 07:55.070
Exactly.

07:55.070 --> 07:56.110
Being weak troubles him.

07:56.270 --> 07:57.630
I wonder in what way he's weak.

07:58.150 --> 07:59.430
Well... What...

07:59.430 --> 08:00.110
What does

08:00.110 --> 08:01.550
"physically weak" really mean?

08:01.830 --> 08:02.910
Yezhou Garrison's top one,

08:02.910 --> 08:03.590
He Yan,

08:03.710 --> 08:04.630
is physically weak?

08:04.910 --> 08:05.830
Is that true?

08:08.740 --> 08:09.310
Do you know?

08:09.750 --> 08:10.990
He Yan is physically weak.

08:12.070 --> 08:12.710
The top one

08:12.710 --> 08:13.550
in Yezhou Garrison?

08:13.550 --> 08:14.070
Right.

08:14.070 --> 08:14.710
No way.

08:14.710 --> 08:15.350
Seriously?

08:16.230 --> 08:16.990
Who'd believe that?

08:51.390 --> 08:51.990
(He,)

08:52.510 --> 08:53.150
(we pooled)

08:53.310 --> 08:53.950
(our money)

08:53.990 --> 08:54.830
(to buy these dishes)

08:55.070 --> 08:55.750
(to nourish you.)

08:56.150 --> 08:56.750
(Don't worry.)

08:57.070 --> 08:57.870
(Every problem)

08:58.110 --> 08:58.990
(has its solution.)

08:59.350 --> 09:00.350
(We'll help you).

09:17.670 --> 09:19.230
He, are you in there?

09:20.480 --> 09:21.000
Yes.

09:21.950 --> 09:22.590
Miss Song,

09:22.990 --> 09:24.160
no one else is here. Get in.

09:28.390 --> 09:28.990
Miss Song.

09:31.950 --> 09:32.830
Did you

09:32.830 --> 09:34.150
not sleep well last night?

09:34.590 --> 09:35.830
Or have you faced difficulties?

09:43.350 --> 09:44.100
He,

09:44.750 --> 09:45.630
don't lose heart.

09:46.350 --> 09:47.790
Don't listen to those rumors.

09:48.270 --> 09:49.350
I'll definitely find a way

09:49.550 --> 09:50.270
to cure you.

09:52.590 --> 09:53.230
He,

09:53.430 --> 09:54.990
I... I didn't mean to

09:55.030 --> 09:55.950
touch your sore spot.

09:56.190 --> 09:56.800
Anyway,

09:59.550 --> 10:00.910
what I want to say is

10:01.150 --> 10:02.710
I won't disdain you.

10:03.350 --> 10:04.450
In my heart,

10:04.450 --> 10:05.410
you're the true warrior

10:05.710 --> 10:06.530
and a real hero.

10:07.030 --> 10:07.670
He,

10:07.950 --> 10:09.120
you can definitely be cured.

10:09.470 --> 10:10.070
Stay strong.

10:13.910 --> 10:14.750
M-Miss Song.

10:21.470 --> 10:23.590
Xiao Jue, you ruined my reputation!

10:32.990 --> 10:33.500
You ruined

10:33.750 --> 10:34.550
my reputation!

10:35.150 --> 10:37.550
Now the news of my inadequacy has spread

10:38.110 --> 10:39.470
throughout Yezhou Garrison.

10:40.070 --> 10:41.230
They all look at me

10:41.630 --> 10:42.630
as if mourning a death.

10:42.990 --> 10:43.750
Xiao Jue,

10:43.750 --> 10:45.220
you must take full responsibility

10:45.310 --> 10:46.230
for this.

10:47.630 --> 10:48.470
Get me a single room

10:48.590 --> 10:49.470
to have some peace.

11:00.790 --> 11:01.750
Blaming me now?

11:03.270 --> 11:04.270
If not for me last night,

11:05.270 --> 11:06.210
what identity

11:06.690 --> 11:07.750
would you use to stay

11:07.750 --> 11:08.830
in Yezhou Garrison?

11:11.270 --> 11:12.420
Naturally

11:12.910 --> 11:15.150
as your personal guard.

11:17.430 --> 11:18.270
Or

11:18.630 --> 11:19.910
do you want me to say

11:20.750 --> 11:21.590
I'm your

11:23.510 --> 11:24.710
beloved?

11:33.030 --> 11:33.950
I said I'd consider it.

11:34.670 --> 11:35.830
You're biting the feeding...

11:36.750 --> 11:37.570
kicking the ladder.

11:47.190 --> 11:47.750
I don't care.

11:49.150 --> 11:50.030
I've decided.

11:50.350 --> 11:51.190
I'm yours now.

11:51.350 --> 11:52.030
Treat me nicer.

11:52.070 --> 11:53.230
Love and protect me. Okay?

11:54.030 --> 11:54.990
I'm not leaving.

12:15.550 --> 12:16.950
That's the partition in my tent.

12:17.790 --> 12:18.830
Don't you want peace?

12:19.550 --> 12:20.070
Live there

12:20.630 --> 12:21.570
and serve as my guard.

12:22.710 --> 12:23.790
No one will disturb you.

12:31.430 --> 12:32.130
Really?

12:37.150 --> 12:37.830
Thank you.

12:38.710 --> 12:40.150
Commander, you should eat more

12:40.150 --> 12:40.950
to nourish yourself.

12:43.710 --> 12:44.550
I'll take my leave.

12:46.990 --> 12:47.990
Good morning, Mr. Feinu.

12:48.390 --> 12:49.190
M-Morning.

12:51.830 --> 12:52.390
Commander,

12:53.150 --> 12:54.150
what happened to him?

12:55.150 --> 12:56.110
He wanted a single room.

12:56.750 --> 12:57.390
I granted it.

12:58.550 --> 12:59.790
Perhaps he's just happy

13:00.710 --> 13:01.310
for that.

13:02.750 --> 13:03.350
A single room?

13:04.070 --> 13:05.350
The new recruits' camp has that?

13:12.230 --> 13:13.380
You put him there?

13:17.030 --> 13:18.070
Only to keep him close

13:19.310 --> 13:20.670
can I observe his tricks better.

14:05.470 --> 14:07.740
(Essentials of Military Strategy)

14:15.990 --> 14:17.760
Having prepared so thoroughly,

14:18.470 --> 14:19.950
he must've planned long ago

14:20.230 --> 14:21.430
to watch me fall to the trap.

14:46.050 --> 14:46.550
Com...

14:49.750 --> 14:50.430
Xiao Jue!

14:51.710 --> 14:53.550
That's outrageous.

14:54.550 --> 14:55.830
Such tight security?

14:56.390 --> 14:57.150
Strangers would

14:57.470 --> 14:58.470
think I'm

14:58.510 --> 14:59.550
a rake sneaking

14:59.590 --> 15:00.510
into boudoirs at night!

15:35.430 --> 15:36.110
Commander?

15:39.310 --> 15:39.990
Commander?

15:41.190 --> 15:42.180
Are you asleep?

15:45.270 --> 15:46.310
I can't sleep.

15:47.230 --> 15:48.030
How about

15:48.790 --> 15:49.990
we chat for a while?

15:59.710 --> 16:00.350
Commander,

16:01.430 --> 16:03.150
I know you don't trust me.

16:03.870 --> 16:05.350
That's why you placed me here.

16:16.390 --> 16:17.250
Commander,

16:17.750 --> 16:18.910
after all,

16:18.910 --> 16:20.230
we've shared hardships together.

16:22.030 --> 16:23.710
Why do you still suspect me?

16:28.910 --> 16:29.590
Commander,

16:30.670 --> 16:31.910
I know about the enmity between

16:31.910 --> 16:32.870
you and He Rufei.

16:35.790 --> 16:37.510
Since his plot failed in Yezhou City,

16:38.070 --> 16:39.790
he's surely plotting another scheme.

16:43.710 --> 16:44.320
Commander,

16:44.470 --> 16:45.070
rest assured.

16:45.750 --> 16:47.470
I'll always stand by your side

16:48.030 --> 16:48.870
and protect you.

16:49.310 --> 16:50.710
I'm the top one of Yezhou Garrison.

16:51.310 --> 16:52.070
One day,

16:52.510 --> 16:53.390
you'll trust me.

16:53.830 --> 16:54.510
Then,

16:54.830 --> 16:56.150
we'll fight side by side,

16:56.430 --> 16:57.550
defending our land

16:57.790 --> 16:58.470
and our people,

16:58.950 --> 17:00.470
so none dare threaten Wei.

17:25.710 --> 17:26.310
Commander,

17:28.150 --> 17:29.830
the moon tonight is breathtaking.

17:31.030 --> 17:32.310
Care to admire it with me?

18:26.300 --> 18:32.480
♪Constant yearning,
still vivid as our first meeting♪

18:33.560 --> 18:39.580
♪Endless gazing.
Step by step, falling deeper♪

18:40.260 --> 18:47.650
♪How to untangle this love,
buried deep within dreams♪

18:48.930 --> 18:54.350
♪My heart, unyielding as stone,
remains true♪

18:55.390 --> 18:59.140
♪Awaiting the crescent moon's
reflection in your heart♪

18:59.490 --> 19:02.080
♪Splendor fades from your eyes♪

19:02.890 --> 19:09.440
♪Crimson threads entwine like rings,
binding our first vow♪

19:09.600 --> 19:13.980
♪Time lingers as you and I share
overlapping palm lines♪

19:13.980 --> 19:17.840
♪Zither and harp
accompany our dancing dreams♪

19:18.400 --> 19:24.510
♪The brocade moon writes our vow,
keeping this promise♪

19:24.830 --> 19:28.740
♪Awaiting the crescent moon's
reflection in your heart♪

19:29.020 --> 19:31.450
♪Splendor fades from your eyes♪

19:31.970 --> 19:38.960
♪Crimson threads entwine like rings,
binding our first vow♪

19:38.960 --> 19:43.610
♪Time lingers as you and I share
overlapping palm lines♪

19:43.610 --> 19:47.460
♪Zither and harp
accompany our dancing dreams♪

19:47.460 --> 19:53.860
♪The brocade moon writes our vow,
keeping this promise♪

20:00.770 --> 20:02.060
(Account Book)

20:02.110 --> 20:05.440
(Records of payoffs and gifts
for Chancellor Xu and his family)

20:20.350 --> 20:20.910
Master,

20:21.590 --> 20:22.910
I retrieved only a few copies.

20:23.630 --> 20:25.150
I'm not sure if they're complete.

20:26.030 --> 20:27.590
I wanted to revisit

20:27.590 --> 20:28.390
Sun Xiangfu's room.

20:29.310 --> 20:30.830
But Xiao Jue's sudden move

20:31.470 --> 20:32.870
got the Sun residence sealed.

20:33.670 --> 20:34.950
I dared not alert them further,

20:35.910 --> 20:36.790
so I stopped looking.

20:39.870 --> 20:41.110
Well,

20:41.670 --> 20:43.270
I'm not blaming you.

20:43.910 --> 20:44.830
This trip

20:45.110 --> 20:46.430
must have been arduous.

20:47.790 --> 20:48.830
It's my honor

20:49.030 --> 20:50.030
to ease your burdens.

20:55.990 --> 20:57.470
My lord, General Feihong is here.

20:58.910 --> 21:00.750
Take him to the reception hall.

21:00.750 --> 21:01.630
Yes, my lord.

21:03.670 --> 21:04.470
You have a guest.

21:05.070 --> 21:06.430
I won't disturb you further.

21:08.430 --> 21:09.070
Zilan,

21:10.710 --> 21:13.150
I'm old.

21:13.870 --> 21:16.030
I don't understand young people's ways.

21:16.510 --> 21:17.750
Some words

21:18.310 --> 21:19.790
are better left unspoken.

21:28.350 --> 21:29.070
My lord,

21:29.870 --> 21:31.710
I sent assassins to Yezhou
to kill Xiao Jue

21:32.270 --> 21:33.830
to share your burden.

21:34.670 --> 21:35.350
But

21:35.630 --> 21:36.430
I never expected...

21:39.150 --> 21:39.750
My lord,

21:40.350 --> 21:41.390
I admit my mistake.

21:57.710 --> 21:58.310
Master,

21:59.150 --> 21:59.870
Ding Yi

22:00.110 --> 22:01.910
grew up with General He since childhood

22:02.230 --> 22:03.230
like brothers.

22:03.790 --> 22:04.670
Surely,

22:06.110 --> 22:07.550
he'll be as reliable

22:07.550 --> 22:08.390
as General He

22:09.670 --> 22:11.190
and leave no traces for Xiao Jue.

22:11.620 --> 22:12.190
Well...

22:12.270 --> 22:13.310
That's right.

22:14.230 --> 22:15.260
My lord, rest assured.

22:15.430 --> 22:16.550
Ding Yi is meticulous.

22:16.830 --> 22:18.110
He'll never give Xiao Jue

22:18.270 --> 22:19.350
any opportunity.

22:23.750 --> 22:24.470
Enough.

22:26.190 --> 22:27.430
Since this matter

22:27.590 --> 22:29.270
left no consequences,

22:30.070 --> 22:31.670
let it end here.

22:32.230 --> 22:32.950
Thank you.

22:37.990 --> 22:39.150
This world

22:39.750 --> 22:42.670
abounds with hidden talents.

22:43.110 --> 22:45.150
But without mentors to recognize them,

22:45.550 --> 22:48.030
they remain buried in obscurity,

22:48.150 --> 22:49.510
unknown to all.

22:56.890 --> 22:58.950
(General Feihong's Mansion)

23:10.990 --> 23:12.950
Why are you still
involved with Chancellor Xu?

23:13.110 --> 23:13.950
Don't you know...

23:22.870 --> 23:23.510
Rufei,

23:24.750 --> 23:25.870
since our family

23:26.150 --> 23:27.470
has secured wealth and status,

23:27.910 --> 23:29.470
we should withdraw while we can.

23:30.070 --> 23:31.350
Do you think Chancellor Xu would

23:31.390 --> 23:32.630
ever let me withdraw unscathed?

23:34.790 --> 23:35.350
Father,

23:36.270 --> 23:37.990
you thought his earlier neglect

23:38.270 --> 23:39.670
meant mercy?

23:41.030 --> 23:42.030
He was merely preparing

23:42.030 --> 23:43.830
to sacrifice me like a pawn.

23:59.710 --> 24:00.270
Young Master,

24:00.590 --> 24:01.430
wasn't the ledger

24:01.470 --> 24:02.510
given to Chancellor Xu?

24:03.270 --> 24:04.150
Why another copy?

24:04.790 --> 24:06.790
(Account Book)
I transcribed some crucial records.

24:06.790 --> 24:08.270
The amount is appalling.

24:09.630 --> 24:11.230
I never imagined Master would embezzle

24:11.830 --> 24:12.830
so many

24:13.230 --> 24:14.670
military provisions and funds

24:15.070 --> 24:16.110
behind His Majesty's back.

24:40.990 --> 24:41.630
Aconite.

24:42.390 --> 24:43.230
Schisandra berries.

25:01.430 --> 25:01.950
Commander,

25:03.190 --> 25:04.860
this is the urgent news from Litai,

25:05.250 --> 25:06.880
(Wutuo people have been)
saying Wutuo people have been

25:06.880 --> 25:08.130
(harassing Litai lately)
harassing them lately.

25:08.470 --> 25:10.310
Litai's magistrate
requests your military aid

25:10.510 --> 25:11.350
to repel them.

25:14.430 --> 25:15.510
Go to Shen Han immediately.

25:15.910 --> 25:16.950
Have him muster 5,000 men

25:17.110 --> 25:19.150
to assemble at the training field
at dawn tomorrow

25:19.630 --> 25:21.310
to depart for Litai with me.

25:21.670 --> 25:23.470
Commander, Wutuo people are fierce.

25:23.910 --> 25:25.110
Yezhou Garrison's new recruits

25:25.190 --> 25:26.310
won't stand against them.

25:26.870 --> 25:28.030
Shall the battalion join us?

25:28.430 --> 25:28.960
Yes.

25:29.950 --> 25:30.590
And He Yan?

25:37.110 --> 25:37.630
No need.

25:37.950 --> 25:38.750
Get prepared first.

25:39.140 --> 25:39.780
Have Ma Damei

25:39.990 --> 25:40.750
watch that person.

25:41.470 --> 25:42.050
Yes.

26:11.230 --> 26:11.780
Commander?

26:12.550 --> 26:13.310
Why are you here?

26:36.110 --> 26:37.110
Why did the wound reopen?

26:37.470 --> 26:39.750
The wound was hard to reach
and apply medicine to.

26:40.070 --> 26:41.430
It reopened easily.

26:42.030 --> 26:42.590
Let me do it.

27:17.550 --> 27:18.910
As Yezhou Garrison's top one,

27:20.070 --> 27:21.590
you've made yourself all wounded.

27:22.630 --> 27:23.830
And you vowed to protect me?

27:25.430 --> 27:26.030
Commander,

27:26.270 --> 27:26.990
so you heard

27:27.030 --> 27:27.990
everything that night?

27:28.230 --> 27:28.830
Why didn't you

27:28.910 --> 27:29.870
answer me?

27:30.830 --> 27:31.750
Duties kept me busy.

27:32.510 --> 27:33.550
No time for your antics.

27:34.430 --> 27:35.590
Well, Commander,

27:36.350 --> 27:37.190
let me accompany you

27:37.310 --> 27:38.590
to Litai tomorrow.

27:39.110 --> 27:40.430
I promised to protect you

27:40.790 --> 27:41.950
and I won't break that vow.

27:43.630 --> 27:45.070
Focus on recovering properly.

27:46.310 --> 27:47.190
Or else I might

27:47.350 --> 27:48.750
end up protecting you instead.

27:52.070 --> 27:52.710
Fine.

27:53.310 --> 27:54.430
Then go with peace of mind.

27:55.070 --> 27:56.110
Yezhou Garrison has me.

28:48.670 --> 28:49.230
Done.

28:57.790 --> 28:58.340
Commander,

28:58.430 --> 28:59.030
wait a moment.

28:59.310 --> 29:00.230
I have a gift for you.

29:06.230 --> 29:06.750
Commander,

29:07.030 --> 29:08.150
these are osmanthus candies.

29:08.270 --> 29:08.830
They're sweet.

29:09.030 --> 29:09.830
Eat them on the way.

29:10.790 --> 29:12.030
Do accept them this time.

29:29.470 --> 29:30.390
The moon that night

29:34.430 --> 29:35.070
was beautiful.

30:03.790 --> 30:04.390
Commander,

30:05.070 --> 30:05.980
are you there?

30:36.750 --> 30:37.630
In the past,

30:38.550 --> 30:39.650
he always loved

30:39.650 --> 30:40.870
eating osmanthus candies.

30:44.030 --> 30:44.550
Never mind.

30:44.830 --> 30:46.350
At least he accepted them this time.

31:11.350 --> 31:11.990
(Xiao Jue,)

31:13.070 --> 31:14.350
(you must return safely.)

31:15.310 --> 31:18.070
(And Yezhou Garrison has me.)

31:50.630 --> 31:51.670
Good morning, Commander.

31:57.430 --> 31:58.240
Right.

31:58.870 --> 31:59.470
It's late.

32:00.150 --> 32:02.390
They should've covered
half the distance by now

32:02.750 --> 32:04.070
and be approaching Litai soon.

32:12.190 --> 32:13.150
This must be

32:13.190 --> 32:14.750
from Miss Song.

32:15.670 --> 32:16.430
Where is she?

32:22.670 --> 32:25.150
Even if He can't swallow his pride
to take my medicine,

32:25.710 --> 32:26.590
it's fine.

32:27.470 --> 32:28.630
I won't give up.

32:29.510 --> 32:30.940
I've drafted a prescription.

32:31.870 --> 32:33.030
Once I gather the herbs,

32:33.550 --> 32:35.030
I can develop

32:35.270 --> 32:37.070
a medicine
that enhances physical fitness.

32:38.150 --> 32:38.910
By then,

32:38.910 --> 32:40.190
it'll cure all his ailments.

32:41.590 --> 32:42.310
And that

32:42.350 --> 32:44.350
arrogant Cheng Lisu.

32:44.710 --> 32:45.590
This time I'll

32:45.910 --> 32:46.910
wipe off his smug look.

33:06.110 --> 33:06.670
Someone!

33:07.030 --> 33:08.110
Give me a hand. Hurry up!

33:17.990 --> 33:19.110
He is seriously injured.

33:30.310 --> 33:31.310
Instead of fussing here,

33:31.870 --> 33:33.510
why not tend to your own wounds?

33:34.110 --> 33:35.190
So nosy.

33:40.110 --> 33:40.910
Given his attire,

33:41.110 --> 33:42.350
he is from an ethnic tribe.

34:05.150 --> 34:06.400
We should've done 60 li daily.

34:07.030 --> 34:09.590
But we've only managed
over 20 li after half the day.

34:10.110 --> 34:11.230
The road is too muddy.

34:14.230 --> 34:14.790
Mr. Liang.

34:15.260 --> 34:15.880
Hmm.

34:18.310 --> 34:18.880
Commander,

34:19.790 --> 34:21.190
this man says he has urgent news.

34:23.190 --> 34:24.030
Greetings, Commander.

34:24.429 --> 34:24.989
What is it?

34:25.630 --> 34:27.150
When I rushed from Litai to Yezhou,

34:27.429 --> 34:28.630
the main road 30 li ahead

34:28.710 --> 34:29.630
had already collapsed.

34:30.070 --> 34:31.230
It made the journey harder.

34:32.670 --> 34:33.750
Any alternate routes?

34:34.550 --> 34:35.389
I know

34:35.389 --> 34:36.270
a shortcut to Litai.

34:36.510 --> 34:37.710
It might shorten our travel.

34:50.150 --> 34:50.670
Okay.

34:51.150 --> 34:52.030
You lead the way then.

34:52.429 --> 34:53.510
We'll detour and proceed.

34:54.429 --> 34:54.949
Yes.

35:04.350 --> 35:05.020
Yes.

35:20.710 --> 35:21.470
You go over there.

35:28.150 --> 35:29.310
This year's plum blossoms

35:29.470 --> 35:30.830
bloomed earlier than before.

35:31.510 --> 35:32.550
I suppose this winter

35:32.630 --> 35:33.710
is colder than usual.

35:39.790 --> 35:40.390
Chu Zhao.

35:50.910 --> 35:52.030
Are you here to see me?

35:53.190 --> 35:54.670
I came to pay respects to Master.

35:58.590 --> 36:00.190
Of course, I must greet you as well.

36:02.590 --> 36:03.100
Go.

36:03.270 --> 36:03.910
Pick those twigs

36:03.910 --> 36:05.250
with the finest blossoms.

36:05.350 --> 36:06.190
Give them to Mr. Chu.

36:07.030 --> 36:07.710
Yes.

36:09.990 --> 36:10.590
That one.

36:22.510 --> 36:23.110
Wretch!

36:23.670 --> 36:24.950
Can't even handle simple work!

36:30.510 --> 36:31.840
These were meant for you,

36:32.350 --> 36:33.390
- but she...
- It's fine.

36:34.950 --> 36:36.220
I'll take you to the outskirts,

36:36.670 --> 36:37.470
where plum blossoms

36:37.590 --> 36:38.350
bloom even better.

36:39.190 --> 36:39.870
Deal.

36:40.270 --> 36:41.150
Don't forget it.

36:57.510 --> 36:59.110
Pingting

37:00.190 --> 37:02.470
has been spoiled by me.

37:05.630 --> 37:06.190
Master,

37:07.030 --> 37:09.350
Miss Xu's free-spirited nature

37:10.190 --> 37:11.620
is truly enviable.

37:14.750 --> 37:17.190
Since your return from Yezhou City,

37:17.550 --> 37:19.550
Xiao Jue has enjoyed

37:20.590 --> 37:22.750
uninterrupted success.

37:27.350 --> 37:28.260
Yezhou Garrison

37:29.270 --> 37:30.550
needs some turbulence now.

37:33.210 --> 37:35.370
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

37:35.470 --> 37:39.390
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

37:39.570 --> 37:41.510
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

37:41.610 --> 37:46.540
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

37:58.630 --> 38:00.040
♪I've seen the mountains♪

38:00.240 --> 38:01.660
♪And trodden through ice♪

38:01.920 --> 38:04.740
♪Day after day, I venture alone♪

38:05.040 --> 38:06.440
♪Destiny is my creed♪

38:06.490 --> 38:07.890
♪Ideals surge beneath the surface♪

38:08.040 --> 38:09.840
♪Igniting the flame against the winds♪

38:11.040 --> 38:12.510
♪A restless yearning in my soul♪

38:12.680 --> 38:13.960
♪Gazing through the mire♪

38:14.140 --> 38:16.530
♪Who cares about this boundless void♪

38:16.730 --> 38:18.780
♪Charge ahead with blazing fervor♪

38:19.920 --> 38:21.750
♪Stubbornly fighting with my life♪

38:23.710 --> 38:26.630
♪Soaring across the world's expanse♪

38:26.720 --> 38:29.380
♪There must always be a longing♪

38:29.830 --> 38:34.900
♪Disregard the wounds to seek the light♪

38:35.230 --> 38:37.240
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

38:37.550 --> 38:41.200
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

38:41.430 --> 38:43.320
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

38:43.360 --> 38:47.200
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

38:47.550 --> 38:49.490
♪Chasing the light within my heart♪

38:49.680 --> 38:53.500
♪Burying frailty,
embracing life through death♪

38:53.760 --> 38:59.510
♪You'll meet gazes where storms brew♪

39:00.400 --> 39:05.870
♪With our unwavering true love,
brave the world with me♪

